    "body": "Universal ASH* remains open. This session supplies a complete unconditional upper matching the prior April Theorem6.1 lower: a triangle with a pendant path of l edges has clearing number 6*2^l-2 for every l>=0. Its critical AS pure-tip witness is credited to the source. Selected labelled ancestry pays the one/three-pebble leaf debt without spending unrelated simulated histories. Exact sharp-core pendant-path transfer is proved under explicit boundary hypotheses; triangle-tail stacking has upper <=4*2^l only, with its infinite matching lower still unproved.\n\nS006 Theorems23-27 were cold-audited and all five inherited checkers/auxiliary traces replayed. Distinct full forward/reverse algorithms and an independent literal trace checker validate 64 complete small-family layers, 102639 labelled configurations and 20276 construction traces (389701 legal moves). Finite lengths are exactly0,1,2; the infinite result rests on the full symbolic proof. Old computational cutoffs remain unchanged, including the length6 clearing certificate at47 despite the new symbolic value382.\n\nAll authoritative/catalogue/spec/ledger mirrors, plan hashes, audit and complete FUTURE/UNEXECUTED S008 handoff are included. Historical S006 mutable mirror bytes are explicitly frozen from its pinned head without rewriting old hashes. Final local governance/new checker checks pass; two administrative validation repairs are retained in the log. Hosted job results will be pinned below after completion. No universal gate, novelty, Lean, contact or submission promotion; S008 is not executed.\n\nAtomic authored head: a21ce4702f2d888bd5e6a417a17df0f2095f0b0a; tree8b131edd8973e093f309a58977d29300bb6df7b3; parent/live entry main e320a3c80da3807beb031c8b2dab69bfb807805c. Ordinary non-force two-parent merge only after actual hosted checks are inspected.\n",
